        },
        {
          "text": "Ungenzele i-altare lomhlabathi, unikele phezu kwalo iminikelo yakho yokushiswa neminikelo yakho yokubonga, izimvu zakho nezinkomo zakho phezu kwalo; kuzo zonke izindawo lapho engichaza khona igama lami, ngizoza kuwe futhi ngikubusise.",
